------------------
-
-Types with tp_as_sequence defined
-
-* multiarray/descriptor.c
-* multiarray/scalartypes.c.src
-* multiarray/arrayobject.c
-
-PySequenceMethods in py3k are binary compatible with py2k, but some of the
